{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"600697e2-60a3-4d18-a896-189ef5a5ce1b","id":"3bca2f13-d743-41f1-a841-562e4eedace7","timestamp":"2026-11-10T12:40:26.909Z","version":"2.1.321","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"252f08e9b1f4f30ab53a8a42c8a117512122e23aeda8f9620166be14b01d06c9","params":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"9fea87ff-2fea-41ac-980b-b72cb6087681","keep":89,"tail":["1a9cf37913a30007f644bad2c395fc3cd5f89765d0cfc5bf7cb4a4ba4bbe164b","87ff550a6f95a50910e36b9f15604bf32bab8b459c7155b389f80da1a61fd2c2"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",90,"content",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"b7cd9d05d5a9a5a85e810ad6d3da7299ac41ffadf93db776ebe0d2738acde2d3"}
{"parentUuid":"3c1b9a2e-a9e5-4a27-8d7f-8a91e201a3f9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011CguGEBJX6A1KkeGBVBBXk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"CNC 版初稿出来了，五张立体图已发给你，建议先看**爆炸图**，再看三个零件各自的标注图。\n\n## 这一版是什么样\n\n| 零件 | 做法 | 重量 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 法兰座 | 底部照抄现役下盖，上面加立柱 25×25 高 40，再加凸台 20.9 方、长 30 | 371 g |\n| 方管 | 现成 25×25×2，长 327.5，两端各 2 个孔 | 162 g |\n| 杆头 | 凸台插进方管，露在外面 53 长，侧面开装配腔 | 78 g |\n\n三个铝件合计约 612 g。脚本自动核对通过：法兰面到吸盘唇边 436.0，各零件之间无干涉。\n\n## 我替你先定的几处（都可以改）\n\n- **方管壁厚 2 mm**，内腔 21。\n- **螺栓仍用 M3×30**，你手上有现成的。\n- **杆头保留侧面装配腔**，装法和现在的打印件一样。\n- **原杆头端面的六角止转坑取消**：我读原模型时发现它比中间的通孔还小，实际不起作用。\n- **喇叭口取消**，改成根部圆角 R3。\n\n## 还没解决的\n\n- **法兰座的侧臂和后挡板是整块照抄的**，用铝料整体铣会比较费料费工。要不要把它拆成单独一块板，是下一步该讨论的。\n- **管线包固定在哪里**我仍然不确定，模型里那块带 2 个孔的后挡板可能就是，需要你确认。\n- 平面图纸也画了，但只是草案，公差没标全，不能直接交加工厂。\n- 效果图是电脑渲染的示意，实物颜色以加工厂样板为准。\n\n## 另外两件事\n\n- **D 盘空间**：统计还在后台跑，没出结果，出来后我再告诉你哪些占得多，不会直接删。\n- 装了一个独立环境 `D:\\miniconda\\envs\\cad`，没动 robot 环境。代码和图都已提交。\n\n文件都在 `3D_model/CNC末端/`，立体图在其中的 `渲染图/`，平面图在 `图纸/`，STEP 模型在根目录。\n\n你先看爆炸图，整体结构和你想的一样吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1445,"cache_read_input_tokens":265443,"output_tokens":807,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1445,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":807,"cache_read_input_tokens":265443,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1445,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1445},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9e7003d8-7c2a-4466-b8af-a326428f0605","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CguGEB2QQ76Jbe3d9iVYt","requestRef":"3bca2f13-d743-41f1-a841-562e4eedace7","requestedModel":"claude-fable-5-2","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"b311cea7-31ea-4ea9-89d3-739d1cfad0ea","timestamp":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.756Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"600697e2-60a3-4d18-a896-189ef5a5ce1b","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"mellow-beaming-gosling"}
