{"parentUuid":"f3751045-614f-4f30-bccd-a84d22c9deee","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011CguN7ptEKkfeMHDDZgd7U","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":278,"cache_read_input_tokens":339320,"output_tokens":941,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":349},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":278,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":941,"cache_read_input_tokens":339320,"cache_creation_input_tokens":278,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":278},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":4029,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"92a50e1c-371a-4559-b9b9-2618264fd4ed","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CguN7di279VNcC1BbujNq","requestRef":"de0e2571-2d11-47e5-af84-b5cd55dd1532","requestedModel":"claude-fable-5-2","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"944c4976-8ff6-4e7f-9be0-9a8829403400","timestamp":"2026-11-10T13:57:46.608Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"600697e2-60a3-4d18-a896-189ef5a5ce1b","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"mellow-beaming-gosling"}
{"parentUuid":"944c4976-8ff6-4e7f-9be0-9a8829403400","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011CguN7ptEKkfeMHDDZgd7U","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"理解了。我复述一遍，你看对不对：\n\n**侧臂**\n- 作用是装相机。\n- 6 个小孔是 3 排、每排 2 个，当初为了能前后挪相机位置。现在实际只用其中一排。\n- 方孔是让气管穿过的。\n\n**后挡板**\n- 2 个圆孔固定机器人管线包的起始端。\n- 方窗也是让气管穿过的。\n\n**气管的走向**：从机械臂那边过来，先穿过后挡板的方窗，再穿过侧臂的方孔，到立柱朝相机一侧的进气长孔，进入杆内。这也解释了为什么进气口要朝相机一侧。\n\n有一处我想核对。你说用的是\"最上面\"的一排，我从模型里看，相机中心离杆轴 80 mm，对应的是**离杆最远、最靠近后挡板**的那一排。是这一排吗？\n\n知道这些用途后，这部分可以这样简化，功能不变：\n\n| 现在 | 改成 | 原因 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 6 个相机孔 | 只留实际用的 2 个 | 位置已经定了，不用再调 |\n| 侧臂的方孔 | 长圆孔（两头是圆的） | 只是过气管，圆角铣刀直接能做 |\n| 后挡板的方窗 | 长圆孔 | 同上 |\n| 后挡板的 2 个圆孔 | 不变 | 管线包位置不能动 |\n\n相机那 2 个孔的位置一点不动，所以手眼标定仍然不用重做。\n\n剩下的问题是侧臂和后挡板**做成一整块还是拆成两块板**，这个等你确认上面那一排孔之后再讨论。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":278,"cache_read_input_tokens":339320,"output_tokens":941,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":349},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":278,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":941,"cache_read_input_tokens":339320,"cache_creation_input_tokens":278,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":278},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"92a50e1c-371a-4559-b9b9-2618264fd4ed","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CguN7di279VNcC1BbujNq","requestRef":"de0e2571-2d11-47e5-af84-b5cd55dd1532","requestedModel":"claude-fable-5-2","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"73edaf7c-3788-49b9-b689-a0e8eda976e1","timestamp":"2026-11-10T13:57:52.852Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"600697e2-60a3-4d18-a896-189ef5a5ce1b","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"mellow-beaming-gosling"}
