{"parentUuid":"bdf13a24-eef9-49ac-a489-a75aa45e3404","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011CguNNfFCeYUKgRZezwij1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"查了手眼标定的结果，结论是**离杆最远的那一排（80 mm 那排）**，和模型里画的一致。\n\n依据：\n\n- 手眼矩阵给出的相机光心位置，离杆轴 **76.6 mm**。\n- 三排孔离杆轴分别是 60、70、80 mm。\n- 76.6 离 80 那排差 3.4 mm，离 70 那排差 6.6 mm，离 60 那排差 16.6 mm。\n\n差的这 3.4 mm 是合理的：手眼标定给出的是相机内部光心的位置，不是安装螺丝孔的位置，两者本来就不重合，加上手眼标定自身有 1~2 mm 的误差。\n\n要说明的是，这是推断而不是直接证据。70 那排差 6.6 mm，不能百分之百排除。最稳妥的做法是你哪天路过设备时看一眼螺丝拧在第几排，十秒钟的事。\n\n在你确认之前，我先按 80 这排继续往下做，可以吗？如果可以，下一步就讨论侧臂和后挡板是做成一整块还是拆成两块板。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1186,"cache_read_input_tokens":340692,"output_tokens":808,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":420},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1186,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":808,"cache_read_input_tokens":340692,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1186,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1186},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"095642a5-e0d3-48ca-9ef5-f51ac0a249b6","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CguNNeyq3pqyEUjQBCL2N","requestRef":"fc063403-97d9-4ceb-83cd-9ffc1edb7ad9","requestedModel":"claude-fable-5-2","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"700ba1f8-7c8a-403d-a3e1-45c42db1ff0b","timestamp":"2026-11-10T14:01:13.165Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"600697e2-60a3-4d18-a896-189ef5a5ce1b","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"m