{"parentUuid":"198b8389-0a39-41db-b15b-7c0ce80c2634","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011CguNc28BkpiEgV9QuFVYK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8,"cache_read_input_tokens":342686,"output_tokens":1608,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":926},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1608,"cache_read_input_tokens":342686,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":13009,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"a4adb5bb-01e0-41ea-9b75-f159d55f8590","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CguNc1fe4ND4ew3Kz2kS6","requestRef":"b6c93551-48e9-41ba-9198-7975ae1c7462","requestedModel":"claude-fable-5-2","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"70bd35e7-3f78-4c35-a8b3-6c70eb723022","timestamp":"2026-11-10T14:04:17.919Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"600697e2-60a3-4d18-a896-189ef5a5ce1b","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"mellow-beaming-gosling"}
{"parentUuid":"70bd35e7-3f78-4c35-a8b3-6c70eb723022","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011CguNc28BkpiEgV9QuFVYK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这一步要定的是：侧臂和后挡板，做成一整块，还是拆开。\n\n先说一个关键事实：**相机装在侧臂上，不在后挡板上**。后挡板只管两件事：固定管线包、让气管穿过，这两件事都不要求精度。\n\n所以我的建议是**只把后挡板拆出来**：\n\n| | 主体 | 后挡板 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 包含 | 圆盘 + 立柱 + 凸台 + 侧臂 | 一块小的 L 形板 |\n| 做法 | CNC，一整块 | 单独一件，用 2 颗螺丝拧在侧臂末端的下面 |\n| 精度要求 | 高（法兰、相机、杆都在这一件上） | 低 |\n\n这样分的好处：\n\n- **相机精度不受影响**。相机、法兰孔、凸台仍然在同一块料上，一次加工出来，手眼标定不用重做。\n- **主体变得好加工**。侧臂和圆盘是同一个平面上的一块平板，从上面一刀一刀铣就行。去掉垂直的后挡板后，需要的铝块高度从约 143 降到约 77，料少一半，也不用翻过来掏深腔。\n- **后挡板很便宜**。就是一块折了 90° 的小板，上面 2 个圆孔加 1 个长圆孔。\n\n代价有两个：\n\n- 主体侧臂末端要**攻 2 个螺纹孔**（比如 M4），用来固定后挡板。这是整套设计里唯一需要攻丝的地方。\n- 原来的两片三角加强筋没有了。铝板比打印件硬得多，我判断够用，但管线包在手腕转动时拉扯的力有多大我没有数据，这一点需要装上后实际观察。\n\n另一种做法是维持一整块不拆，精度和强度最好，但加工费会明显更高。我没有报价，说不出具体差多少。\n\n你同意把后挡板拆出来单独做吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8,"cache_read_input_tokens":342686,"output_tokens":1608,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":926},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1608,"cache_read_input_tokens":342686,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"a4adb5bb-01e0-41ea-9b75-f159d55f8590","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CguNc1fe4ND4ew3Kz2kS6","requestRef":"b6c93551-48e9-41ba-9198-7975ae1c7462","requestedModel":"claude-fable-5-2","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"50f6878e-8411-4600-9d3b-c8d89188624b","timestamp":"2026-11-10T14:04:25.629Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"600697e2-60a3-4d18-a896-189ef5a5ce1b","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"mellow-beaming-gosling"}
