{"parentUuid":"dc759ac5-aac3-444a-be56-108610235ae7","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"19359b89-62b4-4832-8290-305b4d08661f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VspXaSappH7gGF374tiH6f","type":"tool_result","content":"---\nname: scan-turn-bellows-rub\ndescription: 扫码转面(J6 转到约120~257°, 第2~4面)时波纹管真的会碰小臂/手腕, 靠摩擦滑过; 判卷报 link_3/link_4↔末端是真接触, 不是模型保守\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\n2026-10-30 第 7 步出库扫码干跑判出 末端↔link_4(第一手腕, 7.6mm) / 末端↔link_3(小臂, 4.4mm), 只有 J6 在转。我先说成\"碰撞盒余量偏保守、实物没碰\", **用户纠正: 真机确实会碰, 是波纹管碰上后摩擦过去**。\n\n**Why:** 真机日志几百次转到第4面没出事 ≠ 没接触; 柔性波纹管蹭过去不报警也不停。\n**How to apply:** 别再用\"真机没出事\"推断\"没碰\"; 这类接触先问用户实物情况。判法/是否改转面方向待用户定。相关 [[cable-envelope]] [[controller-record-not-interpolation]]\n----\n9:scan_hover: [-0.216382, -0.406378, -1.187670, 0.023138, 1.570379, -0.216524]   # 扫码口中心上方10cm,垂直向下(标定值计算,2026-08-13; 2026-09-15立放末端按同TCP重IK, 旧[-0.170486,-0.422492,-1.281610,0.133192,1.570364,-0.170653])\n44-  settle_s: 0.6         # 近拍前停稳(0.3不够: 残振拖影致L虚胖, 2026-09-01照片实证)\n45:scan:                   # 扫码\n46-  v_fly: 0.3            # (0.25→0.4第7轮→0.3: 持货飞扫码位, 保守)\n47-  v_desc: 0.25          # (0.15→0.25第7轮)\n48-  v_turn: 0.3           # (原0.15; 第7轮)\n49-  acc: 0.12             # (0.10→0.2第7轮→0.12: 同上回退)\n50-  face_wait_s: 0.5      # 每面等待(不动)\n51-  movej_elbow_deg: 40   # 起点肘J3浅于-40°(接近伸直, 远端边缘抬升点)→飞扫码位改关节空间movej(2026-09-10 仿真: 直线J3峰速1.24→movej 0.54)\n52-  movej_v: 0.5          # 关节空间飞扫码位的速度/加速度\n53-  movej_a: 0.3\n__pycache__\ncable_envelope_gen.py\ncartesian_probe.py\nceiling.py\nduco_driver_patch\nenv\nhighlight_object.py\nik_batch.py\nik_cert.py\nik_moveit.py\njudge_batch.sh\nkill_stack.sh\nload_scene.py\nplan_path.py\nreplay_check.py\nros_run.sh\nscene_overlay.py\nself_check.py\nstack\ntable_reach.py\ntcp_solve.py\ntool_overlay.py\nactions/fly.py\nactions/scan.py\ntools/grasp/pick_one_box.py\ntools/grasp/rotator_set.py\ntools/grasp/scan_read.py","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"4961f9f8-1919-4d8e-88d7-21012bb989c9","timestamp":"2026-11-10T14:08:39.052Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"---\nname: scan-turn-bellows-rub\ndescription: 扫码转面(J6 转到约120~257°, 第2~4面)时波纹管真的会碰小臂/手腕, 靠摩擦滑过; 判卷报 link_3/link_4↔末端是真接触, 不是模型保守\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\n2026-10-30 第 7 步出库扫码干跑判出 末端↔link_4(第一手腕, 7.6mm) / 末端↔link_3(小臂, 4.4mm), 只有 J6 在转。我先说成\"碰撞盒余量偏保守、实物没碰\", **用户纠正: 真机确实会碰, 是波纹管碰上后摩擦过去**。\n\n**Why:** 真机日志几百次转到第4面没出事 ≠ 没接触; 柔性波纹管蹭过去不报警也不停。\n**How to apply:** 别再用\"真机没出事\"推断\"没碰\"; 这类接触先问用户实物情况。判法/是否改转面方向待用户定。相关 [[cable-envelope]] [[controller-record-not-interpolation]]\n----\n9:scan_hover: [-0.216382, -0.406378, -1.187670, 0.023138, 1.570379, -0.216524]   # 扫码口中心上方10cm,垂直向下(标定值计算,2026-08-13; 2026-09-15立放末端按同TCP重IK, 旧[-0.170486,-0.422492,-1.281610,0.133192,1.570364,-0.170653])\n44-  settle_s: 0.6         # 近拍前停稳(0.3不够: 残振拖影致L虚胖, 2026-09-01照片实证)\n45:scan:                   # 扫码\n46-  v_fly: 0.3            # (0.25→0.4第7轮→0.3: 持货飞扫码位, 保守)\n47-  v_desc: 0.25          # (0.15→0.25第7轮)\n48-  v_turn: 0.3           # (原0.15; 第7轮)\n49-  acc: 0.12             # (0.10→0.2第7轮→0.12: 同上回退)\n50-  face_wait_s: 0.5      # 每面等待(不动)\n51-  movej_elbow_deg: 40   # 起点肘J3浅于-40°(接近伸直, 远端边缘抬升点)→飞扫码位改关节空间movej(2026-09-10 仿真: 直线J3峰速1.24→movej 0.54)\n52-  movej_v: 0.5          # 关节空间飞扫码位的速度/加速度\n53-  movej_a: 0.3\n__pycache__\ncable_envelope_gen.py\ncartesian_probe.py\nceiling.py\nduco_driver_patch\nenv\nhighlight_object.py\nik_batch.py\nik_cert.py\nik_moveit.py\njudge_batch.sh\nkill_stack.sh\nload_scene.py\nplan_path.py\nreplay_check.py\nros_run.sh\nscene_overlay.py\nself_check.py\nstack\ntable_reach.py\ntcp_solve.py\ntool_overlay.py\nactions/fly.py\nactions/scan.py\ntools/grasp/pick_one_box.py\ntools/grasp/rotator_set.py\ntools/grasp/scan_read.py","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"b4a07192-394d-4934-be62-7bd9b0c1ca29","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/d/robot_cell","root":"/d/robot_cell","branch":"exp/stand-place","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":