{"parentUuid":"5f3e5c74-3632-4a2e-bbe5-9813957dbb5d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011CguPceEwEpz4qnmd8sC73","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可以，而且能缩的空间不小。先说现在的尺寸（从模型里读的）：\n\n| | 现在 |\n|---|---|\n| 后挡板宽度 | 80 mm |\n| 后挡板长度（从法兰面往后） | 66 mm |\n| 两个固定孔的间距 | 30 mm |\n| 孔离法兰面 | 42 mm |\n| 孔以下还多出来的板 | 24 mm |\n\n两个孔只占中间 30 mm，板却有 80 宽、孔下面还多出 24 mm，这些都是多余的。\n\n我建议这样缩，孔间距 30 不变：\n\n- **宽度 80 → 50**：两边各收 15，孔到板边还留 10 mm。\n- **长度 66 → 50**：孔下面只留 8 mm，去掉 16。\n- **四个外角倒大圆角**：转的时候最先靠近手腕的就是角。\n\n这样后挡板的两个下角各往里收了十几毫米，正是图里贴近手腕的位置。\n\n还有一个更大的余地要问你：**两个孔离法兰面的距离（现在 42 mm）能不能也改小？** 比如改成 30，板还能再短 12 mm。但这样管线包的起始端会往法兰方向挪 12 mm，我不知道管线包的长度有没有这个余量，这个只有你在现场能判断。\n\n孔的高度是保持 42 不动，还是可以往上挪？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":43,"cache_read_input_tokens":373998,"output_tokens":1018,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":528},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":43,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1018,"cache_read_input_tokens":373998,"cache_creation_input_tokens":43,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":43},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"a1f4d357-4652-4fcb-ae4d-79b98f3c0b02","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CguPcdrNjsxUmk83rJaym","requestRef":"d0b9eb48-6c8b-4cfe-931b-9823b7ef1f00","requestedModel":"claude-fable-5-2","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"52e62ebd-916d-4f37-a922-f7415490617a","timestamp":"2026-11-10T14:17:33.431Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","c