{"parentUuid":"e91dc1b5-6df6-48f3-8565-d7279ffb0821","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011CguPioBsih2Rjsom3MzHo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你的担心是对的，所以**孔的高度不动，保持 42**。\n\n原因：气管从管线包出来，要先穿过后挡板的方窗，再拐弯穿过侧臂的方孔。管线包固定点离方窗越近，气管拐弯的地方就越短、越急。把孔往上挪正好会让这里折得更厉害。6 mm 的 PU 气管弯曲半径小于约 15 mm 就容易折扁，折扁了吸力会下降。\n\n所以只做不影响气管的那部分缩减：\n\n| | 现在 | 改成 | 影响气管吗 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 宽度 | 80 | 50 | 不影响，气管在中间走 |\n| 孔下面多出的板 | 24 | 8 | 不影响，在孔的下面 |\n| 外角 | 直角 | 大圆角 | 不影响 |\n| 孔间距 | 30 | 30 | — |\n| 孔离法兰面 | 42 | 42 | — |\n\n另外可以顺手让气管走得更顺，比现在还好一点：\n\n- **两个过气管的孔改成长圆孔并加长**，气管可以斜着穿过去，不用硬拐直角。\n- **孔口倒圆角**，气管贴着的边不是尖的，不会被硌出折痕。\n\n15 mm 这个弯曲半径是这类气管的常见数值，我没有查你这根气管的规格书，仅供判断方向用。\n\n按这个方案把后挡板拆出来建模，可以吗？做完我在立体网页里更新，你可以转着看气管的通道。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":29,"cache_read_input_tokens":375061,"output_tokens":841,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":297},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":29,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":841,"cache_read_input_tokens":375061,"cache_creation_input_tokens":29,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":29},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7c5de4da-e8d7-4007-bdc1-e2776ec1e385","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CguPint1wiWpeRGd89TUZ","requestRef":"42a13f7d-0deb-483a-9cb1-eed2f22533e2","requestedModel":"claude-fable-5-2","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"4de6b1d8-ded1-4374-bec4-7e1238a48d25","timestamp":"2026-11-10T14:18:53.827Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint