{"parentUuid":"1985fdf1-5603-4dde-aa49-96262723a3cc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011CguQCLJPion3f9t5cSCHN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对比图发给你了，左边是现在的，右边是改后的。都是从背面斜下方看：红色是后挡板，蓝色是气管，深灰是相机。\n\n看图时注意三处：\n\n- **红色板的大小**：左边是一整面 80 宽的大板，右边只剩中间一条 50 宽的，下面也短了一截，两个下角是圆的。\n- **两个圆孔**：左右两张图里位置完全一样，这就是固定管线包的孔。\n- **气管穿过的地方**：左边是一个小方窗，气管要在窗口处拐一个比较急的弯。右边是一条竖着的长圆孔，气管可以顺着斜穿过去。\n\n立体网页也更新了，多了\"④ 后挡板\"这个零件，你可以自己转到背面看，拉开滑块能看到它是怎么从侧臂下面拆下来的：\nhttps://claude.ai/artifact/9E7JZ8P2xc6rAPo13UqKe5\n\n说明两点：\n\n- 图里的气管是我按大致走向画的示意，实际气管怎么弯取决于你怎么装，不是精确的。\n- 网页这次更新后我没有再打开检查，模型本身的核对是通过的（四个铝件无干涉，总长 436.0）。\n\n这样缩短，是你想要的样子吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":665,"cache_read_input_tokens":398589,"output_tokens":448,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":665,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":448,"cache_read_input_tokens":398589,"cache_creation_input_tokens":665,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":665},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"88a27146-50f2-4bdf-a88b-ec9f7630dcca","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CguQCKy3q9KYKE7Cryqw7","requestRef":"3ff89508-e4c9-4b11-a88f-f345055a6a30","requestedModel":"claude-fable-5-2","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"1d02e1d5-3e85-417b-9c07-294835cd9701","timestamp":"2026-11-10T14:25:03.152Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"600697e2-60a3-4d18-a896-189ef5a5